WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.279 --> 00:00:05.839
I need your help!

00:00:06.628 --> 00:00:09.293
So I’m writing a book about ‘One Word’

00:00:09.496 --> 00:00:11.204
and I’ve talked about One Word a lot.

00:00:11.204 --> 00:00:13.096
Basically I believe that everybody has one word

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:13.881
that defines them

00:00:14.211 --> 00:00:15.192
defines who they are

00:00:15.192 --> 00:00:17.495
and when you understand what your one word is

00:00:17.495 --> 00:00:20.288
what your core is it makes it so much easier

00:00:20.288 --> 00:00:22.680
to make every decision better

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.965
easier in your life and in your business.

00:00:25.106 --> 00:00:27.339
Some people see that message

00:00:27.339 --> 00:00:28.924
they love it, they apply it immediately

00:00:28.924 --> 00:00:31.336
they see great results; others are skeptical.

00:00:31.336 --> 00:00:33.186
They think, “Ah, it’s just a motivating thing.

00:00:33.493 --> 00:00:34.561
This isn’t going to take off.

00:00:34.561 --> 00:00:35.635
This isn’t for me.

00:00:35.913 --> 00:00:38.956
For me, BELIEVE isn’t just a motivating thing.

00:00:39.245 --> 00:00:40.589
It should motivate you because your

00:00:40.643 --> 00:00:42.281
One Word should be inspiring

00:00:42.281 --> 00:00:43.281
should get you awake in the morning

00:00:43.281 --> 00:00:45.136
should get you excited to start your day

00:00:45.136 --> 00:00:48.469
but it helps make me understand

00:00:48.469 --> 00:00:50.156
and make decisions for everything

00:00:50.156 --> 00:00:51.016
that I do in my business

00:00:51.016 --> 00:00:52.196
and in my life.

00:00:52.236 --> 00:00:53.873
So if I’m creating a social media campaign

00:00:54.144 --> 00:00:55.320
it’s got to be about BELIEVE.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:58.168
If I am bringing on a new person on my team

00:00:58.168 --> 00:00:59.863
they have to be about BELIEVE.

00:01:00.188 --> 00:01:03.033
If I’m launching a program with a new client

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:04.423
they have to be about BELIEVE.

00:01:04.509 --> 00:01:07.281
So BELIEVE is the core of everything that I do

00:01:07.521 --> 00:01:09.286
and all my decisions is filtered through that

00:01:09.431 --> 00:01:12.711
and if it’s BELIEVE related then I can continue with it

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.896
if it’s not then it’s the wrong client

00:01:15.101 --> 00:01:17.621
or it’s the wrong campaign or it’s the wrong employee.

00:01:18.076 --> 00:01:20.151
And so I want to encourage entrepreneurs

00:01:20.151 --> 00:01:21.762
to find their own One Word

00:01:21.762 --> 00:01:23.683
and then use that to apply

00:01:23.856 --> 00:01:26.723
to make every decision in their business and life easier.

00:01:27.126 --> 00:01:28.661
So I have a few examples

00:01:29.013 --> 00:01:30.254
that I am writing about in my book.

00:01:30.254 --> 00:01:33.274
We’ve got 3M where INNOVATION is their One Word

00:01:33.923 --> 00:01:36.281
and you know, you have to be innovative to work at 3M.

00:01:36.281 --> 00:01:37.656
If you’re not innovative

00:01:37.656 --> 00:01:40.151
then you’re not going to have fun there

00:01:40.151 --> 00:01:41.427
you’re not going to be successful there

00:01:41.427 --> 00:01:43.353
you’re not going to have a great career there.

00:01:43.938 --> 00:01:45.503
There’s Jessica Alba who’s launched

00:01:45.588 --> 00:01:46.731
the Honest Company

00:01:46.731 --> 00:01:48.676
and so HONESTY is her One Word.

00:01:49.033 --> 00:01:50.723
If you are not honest

00:01:50.738 --> 00:01:52.038
you’re not going

00:01:52.038 --> 00:01:54.698
to have a great time working with Jessica Alba.

00:01:54.858 --> 00:01:57.048
You know, your business won’t last long

00:01:57.048 --> 00:01:57.913
working with her

00:01:57.921 --> 00:02:00.474
you won’t’ last long as her employee working with her

00:02:00.474 --> 00:02:02.528
and her marketing has to be about honesty.

00:02:03.273 --> 00:02:04.961
What I’m looking for is more examples

00:02:05.781 --> 00:02:07.943
and ideally bigger name examples.

00:02:07.943 --> 00:02:10.278
People who you look at and you can say

00:02:10.278 --> 00:02:11.992
“Yeah, I know who that person is.”

00:02:12.157 --> 00:02:14.898
I’ve got a lot of great smaller entrepreneur examples

00:02:14.898 --> 00:02:16.258
which I’m going to share too.

00:02:16.258 --> 00:02:17.967
But I’m looking for kind of the bigger name people

00:02:17.967 --> 00:02:18.695
who have done this.

00:02:19.568 --> 00:02:21.228
And so I need your help!

00:02:21.228 --> 00:02:24.366
If you guys know of any successful

00:02:24.366 --> 00:02:25.936
kind of name brand person

00:02:25.936 --> 00:02:27.318
who’s used this in their business

00:02:27.318 --> 00:02:29.746
or their life and just like a marketing slogan

00:02:29.746 --> 00:02:31.431
you know, Coca Cola may come up

00:02:31.431 --> 00:02:33.161
with a marketing slogan for one year

00:02:33.161 --> 00:02:35.386
that’s one word but then the next year changes

00:02:35.386 --> 00:02:36.034
and the next year changes.

00:02:36.034 --> 00:02:38.289
I’m not looking just looking for a marketing thing.

00:02:38.289 --> 00:02:40.103
This is the core of everything.

00:02:40.103 --> 00:02:41.638
This is the core of how you define your life

00:02:41.638 --> 00:02:44.044
and then live through that One Word.

00:02:44.479 --> 00:02:46.856
And so if you guys have any examples

00:02:47.226 --> 00:02:49.816
if you’re researching or coming across any stories

00:02:49.816 --> 00:02:51.606
that you think would apply

00:02:51.798 --> 00:02:53.526
please let me know.

00:02:53.721 --> 00:02:54.851
Leave it in the comments

00:02:55.013 --> 00:02:55.886
message me

00:02:56.081 --> 00:02:57.901
whatever else works

00:02:58.119 --> 00:02:59.201
a way to reach out to me

00:02:59.273 --> 00:03:00.162
I’m pretty accessible.

00:03:00.686 --> 00:03:01.444
Let me know.

00:03:01.451 --> 00:03:04.216
I really want this book to help start a revolution

00:03:04.291 --> 00:03:07.743
and really help people live their life on purpose

00:03:07.959 --> 00:03:10.286
instead of walking aimlessly through it

00:03:10.508 --> 00:03:13.630
and I would love to have you be a part of it.

00:03:15.426 --> 00:03:16.377
So let me know if you can help

00:03:16.506 --> 00:03:17.746
share some ideas.

00:03:17.875 --> 00:03:18.993
I’d love to hear from you.

00:03:19.131 --> 00:03:20.093
Believe!

00:03:20.384 --> 00:03:21.450
Thank you guys so much.

00:03:21.662 --> 00:03:23.182
I’m looking forward to your comments.

00:03:23.322 --> 00:03:24.994
Don’t forget to subscribe to the channel

00:03:24.994 --> 00:03:26.639
click on my face and I will see you soon.

